cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use auto-econ-sentiment in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "auto-econ-sentiment: Reproducible Infrastructure for Sentiment Analysis"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline for measuring economic sentiment in central bank and
  financial text. It loads and cleans text, scores it with six economic
  dictionaries and optional transformer and LLM classifiers, and exports every
  measure on a shared scale for side-by-side comparison.
authors:
  - family-names: Baird
    given-names: Cory
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-28"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/corybaird/auto-econ-sentiment"
url: "https://github.com/corybaird/auto-econ-sentiment"
keywords:
  - sentiment analysis
  - central bank communication
  - economics
  - natural language processing
  - reproducible research
